{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8dd81a720a5a4eff0cd99df3e1c96acfa7987c21d058d11b8018809b6e6cb795", "ja": "それは幼き少年の追想\n――イーサンと＜アリス＞の出会い。\n或いは、ひとりの少女の回顧\n――モーガンと＜アナ＞の出会い。\nそれは……彼女達の中に眠る、記憶。", "zh": "那是一个年幼少年的追忆  \n――イーサン与＜アリス＞的相遇。  \n又或许，是一名少女的回忆  \n――モーガン与＜アナ＞的相遇。  \n那是……沉睡在她们心中的记忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "eec4936e3b0c84762cbd4a98532156fd4834c349f15f279f62625bd849f81c81", "ja": "（僕があの女……『アリス』と初めて出会ったのは、\n物心つくかつかないかの頃だったと思う）", "zh": "（我第一次遇见那个女人……“爱丽丝”，应该是在还不太懂事的时候）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e94a3cc58528e6250cb600d5fb6dedc5738e070497522aa9c7b8fa2a9b3b87a", "ja": "おねえさんは、おとうさんのお友達？", "zh": "大姐姐是爸爸的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "680d1d191f68644d7b0b6440fe9611c1a585d300821a0f6269bc819f713c7f60", "ja": "そうよ、アリスっていうの。\n知らない人に挨拶できて、えらいね。", "zh": "对呀，我叫爱丽丝。能向陌生人打招呼，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "6c114015bdcfac171fce1e14a5b8c8adac8e4c9b00678e913767104ea5f5f465", "ja": "ぼくは『2代目』だから。\nファミリーのみんなを、まもらなくちゃ。", "zh": "因为我是第2代嘛。\n所以必须保护家族里的大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "024e4b9201f6ddfda9b7f2f7029e9d6f64ef297c1bf4f16770c464823e39bc6b", "ja": "それで、不審なヤツがいないか監視してるんだね。\n……ねえ、あの公園なんて怪しいと思わない？", "zh": "所以，你是在监视有没有可疑的家伙，对吧。  \n……喂，你不觉得那座公园很可疑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "c39fd06fbe197a3b858208dee0eca9f0cd25e748c15d8c8398340aed12af8784", "ja": "あやしいかも……。\nうん、しらべに行こう！", "zh": "可能很可疑呢……\n嗯，我们去调查一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1006_null", "source_sha256": "2f3f256a92d931a8c3eef2de432365b0cf23b2baede9a76a6dc1614b99a16ec9", "ja": "そして、数年後……", "zh": "然后，几年后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c2e5e38baee7138405a2f70e0503fc93bfb963a37ad1ba3895eac51afbd04327", "ja": "久し振りだね、イーサン。\n変わりはない？", "zh": "好久不见，伊桑。你还是没变吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "fae8bbcbe884e546fed609aaca747c7e6d821b5cc13e3a44983492d478ab9319", "ja": "……。それは皮肉か？　アリス。\n僕は変わりないよ、文字通りな。", "zh": "……。那是在挖苦我吗？爱丽丝。\n我可是一点都没变啊，字面意义上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae95c8467170ac89d251eeb363757b9ccc74b62c635d58eb08eaada34c8c9707", "ja": "お前と初めて会った頃から、何も変わらない。\n能力と引き換えとはいえ、不便で仕方がないな。", "zh": "从第一次见到你的时候起，就什么都没变。\n虽说是以能力为代价，但实在是太不方便了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "10ee216cdb4eb1e67fef2990caf8455140200a7b2516e565cf8c0b58faf8fbc9", "ja": "確かに、人を強烈に惹きつけるカリスマ性なんて、\nマフィアにはもってこいの力だよね。", "zh": "确实，那种能强烈吸引人的魅力，\n对黑手党来说简直是再合适不过的能力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "66436ce30335fcdbf83197305fef06a545e11414c0a6d0dc949f2cda34c41fa3", "ja": "……ところでお前、この前僕が話しかけたら\n驚いて逃げたな。あれはどういうつもりだ？", "zh": "……话说回来，上次我跟你搭话的时候，\n你竟然吓得逃走了。你那是打算干什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bf09be364151ec735b86f8d78aed0e138322779961abc292462cefb545b2d86a", "ja": "まあ、こっちも色々あってさ。\nあの時の私は、私じゃなかったっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯，我这边也发生了不少事嘛。该说那时候的我，已经不是原来的我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "35d98af358b1e0d29f3916db49248b66425f653b73417bc38923fdc6496ce662", "ja": "……？　どういう意味だ。", "zh": "……？是什么意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b9e05fd8cf031d4348da1814a1e393f7a520888cd350097c703fde324be7b204", "ja": "そのままの意味だよ。……私達はきっと、お互いを\n理解できると思うんだ。仲良くしようよ、イーサン。", "zh": "就是字面上的意思。……我想，我们一定能互相理解。和睦相处吧，伊森。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "265d5cb38d10cc1645ebdc856fb50a0ffa5c5ab4388c987b963ded86a0db7ccc", "ja": "（私と『アナ』の出会いは、兄に連れられて行った\n政治家達の集まる退屈なパーティーだった）", "zh": "（我和『安娜』的相遇，是哥哥带我去参加的、聚集着政治家们的无聊派对）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1017_seijika", "source_sha256": "deba6e275bebe2a2d2bd3f602c545eb9e5ca2900b24b335a4b69875d2e753e38", "ja": "では、次の選挙の際もぜひ協力いただければと……。\n教祖様のお力には、期待しておりますので！", "zh": "那么，下次选举时也请务必助我们一臂之力……我们可是很期待教主大人的力量呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1018_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "8f964c69f54e95464e47cbdfede99da6efe5f1a6945947fdfd7a1f8879c28ea6", "ja": "ええ。それがこの世界のためになるなら、\n妹も喜んで協力するでしょう。", "zh": "嗯。如果那能为这个世界带来益处，\n妹妹也会很乐意帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1019_seijika", "source_sha256": "713ac0141298115b03222d60c5fdb0b71668eb330b7f08da90904a2040a10ef8", "ja": "では、詳しいお話をこちらで……！", "zh": "那么，详细内容请看这里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "045d93da338379f3f11f09a6ab950a3407a50198e1176117ffc9403a93dd7015", "ja": "……ふう。", "zh": "……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9f6f986e502058c37e55a36bd2c292d6aec2a4bef006f3f3068fbdc983045ef4", "ja": "せっかくのパーティーなのに、\n随分と退屈そうな顔をしているね。", "zh": "难得的派对，你却摆出一副相当无聊的表情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "2c88f7b6c01c41ae823465b399d45149a542e6f901171e316a1e4b2abb566dbb", "ja": "……貴方は、誰？\n私を誰だか知っていて、話しかけているの？", "zh": "……你是谁？\n你知道我是谁，才来跟我搭话的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15e4348697fea4466d8aa8b01df59931b74f0fdbce8df321f313ef42601dee6d", "ja": "私はアナ。……パーティーでは、\nもっと楽しそうに笑わなきゃ。", "zh": "我是安娜。……在派对上，就该笑得更开心些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "8f96671dac398e7415c2977267a2a33c3aac683e577f231390fed3ab531cbfd9", "ja": "こんな退屈なパーティーの、どこで笑えと？\n偉い人が集金に励む姿も、もう見飽きたわ。", "zh": "这么无聊的派对，你让我在哪儿笑啊？  \n看那些大人物忙着敛财的样子，我也早就看腻了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7090bc6a3a4dad9feba74fdd9ac1df7119196e1a0bfd7b5a0012cd428f28afe5", "ja": "ふふ、そっか。それなら、もっと楽しいところに\n連れ出してあげようか。おいで。", "zh": "呵呵，这样啊。那我带你去更有意思的地方吧。  \n来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "a1a632573a7b6583de3eda36906d6897018512f32fc1756925a1bec1f2f55681", "ja": "えっ……あっ？\nちょっと、どこへ……！", "zh": "诶……啊？\n等一下，你要带我去哪儿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "40c52b7be8d9612524a70d72d2f7b2ac4fe0bf12a6b4a8fccdf0416dad07b451", "ja": "ほら、鳩が寄ってきたよ、モーガン。\n餌をあげたらいい。", "zh": "看，鸽子靠过来了，摩根。\n喂点食物就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd13065ef31d714fd0718e64b1c2e65c5a79c8320b5aba29eee4727d38cd078c", "ja": "は、鳩ってこんなに動き回るの……？\n餌って、どうやって……？", "zh": "鳕、鸽子怎么会这么活跃……？\n要怎么喂才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf5e753518c2b922e43b3efb8dbf1aafc7053cca510457bf0a1245e566f33659", "ja": "こうやって、ほら！　あっ、ちょっと多すぎたな。\nこれだと鳩がたくさん寄ってきて……。", "zh": "像这样，看！啊，好像撒得有点多了。这样一来会有好多鸽子聚过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1030_hato", "source_sha256": "56d0250e2606f9c18ac616555e1a8b31f60d28e4f06e49559fe03928bf3f13ec", "ja": "クルッポー！！！", "zh": "咕咕——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "a9825d4294d60f28e956204c40d96e18ddae457b7415095102338b6a974ed237", "ja": "きゃっ！？　も、もう！\nアナ、貴方わざとやりましたね……！？", "zh": "呀！？ 真、真是的！\n安娜，你是故意的吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "68efa8d0100db6bad9ff83b5fda499d5a639aa688ee6323a5dc3b30186415845", "ja": "あはは、やっと笑った！　……教祖であっても、\n君は君。好きな時に笑っていいのに。", "zh": "啊哈哈，终于笑了！……就算贵为教祖，\n你还是你啊。想笑的时候尽管笑就好了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "37751b8901083f77da89a6d59a56ca863cd7f006be448f736a2ad83316bdbb7e", "ja": "……別に、今に始まった事ではありませんし。\nお兄様は、私を守ってくれているだけですから。", "zh": "……这又不是今天才开始的。\n兄长大人只是在保护我而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20527f2a44a528bf1dab812ccbcdbe9a787c65ae28f8182ad0e313f420a74b4c", "ja": "君はお兄様を信用しているみたいだけど……\n果たして彼は、君の信頼に値する相手かな？", "zh": "你似乎很信任你哥哥……\n但他真的值得你托付这份信任吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a56ba49594298a2ae2a80a4279a6ca211b528c45d5df71873bb1eef1eef92f4c", "ja": "この先どんな事があっても、私は君を裏切らないと\n約束しよう。……それだけは、覚えておいて。", "zh": "无论接下来会发生什么，我都答应你，我绝不会背叛你。……这点，你一定要记住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1037_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "b95f182d84576842f534a67e1b91e7111b41dcebf98922d55905343de5a32b8e", "ja": "モーガン、急にいなくなるなんて……\n貴方の顔見せの場でもあるのに！", "zh": "摩根，居然突然不见了……  \n明明也是让你露面的场合啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "63b55f7cfe54cd63a3786a3ba988c5d0ac23942f1306d8fbdf6be677c89e406e", "ja": "モーガンを叱らないでください、ミスター。\n私が無理に連れ出したんです。", "zh": "请不要责备摩根，先生。是我硬把他带出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "528d9604dae11dd33320b32e7d895bd4f7a03043c13393512e057b6cdc167c8b", "ja": "今日は楽しかったよ、モーガン。\nまたいつか、今日のように話をしよう。約束だ。", "zh": "今天很开心，摩根。  \n改天再像今天这样聊聊天吧。说好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0243_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_07_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0acbfa21efa86c7c7960ba5bf78f2d946ee3b5648e2596b48215774cf1e384b", "ja": "え、ええ。また、いつか……。\n……。", "zh": "诶、嗯。改天再聊……  \n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
